  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "fec0588a-de26-49db-ab27-52af7293d5f9"],
 " is constant, along a leftgoing ray the return arc length: radar \
coordinates are light-cone coordinates."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"baff6210-070e-4d29-8390-57fb7656694e"]
}, Open  ]],

